Buddy temporary test patch for xv6-riscv (branch mm-buddy-slab)

This patch adds, guarded by preprocessor macros, to kernel/kalloc.c:
  - BUDDY_DEBUG:      D1-D7 startup selftest suite (called from kinit)
  - BUDDY_PANIC_CASE: E1-E6 expected-panic cases (one case per boot)

Apply:   patch -p1 < xv6-buddy-tests.patch
Revert:  patch -R -p1 < xv6-buddy-tests.patch

Build functional suite:
  make clean
  make DETFLAGS="-ffile-prefix-map=$(pwd)=. -DBUDDY_DEBUG"
  make fs.img

Build panic case N (N = 1..6; only kalloc.o needs recompiling):
  rm -f kernel/kalloc.o kernel/kernel
  make DETFLAGS="-ffile-prefix-map=$(pwd)=. -DBUDDY_PANIC_CASE=N"

Production build (tests compiled out):
  make clean && make && make fs.img

